   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 1",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Shot 1, three seconds. A family living room at night. The camera is beside the television, at seated height, looking back across the room at the man on the sofa; the television is out of frame and its light flickers on his face. He is mid-bite of a crisp. A woman (S2) says from off-screen, exasperated: <d>[English] Seth. It is in German. Again.</d> He stops chewing. He does not look into the lens."
   ],
   "color": "#232",
   "bgcolor": "#353"
  },
