   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Cut. Shot 4, four seconds. A talking-head confessional: he sits alone against a plain wall in even flat light, framed centre, and looks straight down the barrel of the lens directly into the camera. He holds the look for a moment, entirely deadpan, then gives one small shrug. He (S1) says, flatly, straight to camera: <d>[English] That is Wilson's department.</d>"
   ],
